<concept id="git-addon-review-stage-and-commit-changes">
  <title>Review, Stage, and Commit Changes</title>
  <prolog>
    <metadata>
      <keywords>
        <indexterm>Git Client add-on<indexterm>reviewing changes</indexterm></indexterm>
        <indexterm>Git Client add-on<indexterm>staging changes</indexterm></indexterm>
        <indexterm>Git Client add-on<indexterm>committing changes</indexterm></indexterm>
      </keywords>
    </metadata>
  </prolog>
  <conbody>
    <p id="p_git_review_stage_commit_overview">Use this section for the local change-review workflow in the <xref href="git-addon-git-staging-view-interface.dita#git-addon-git-staging-view-interface"><uicontrol>Git Staging</uicontrol> view</xref>. Review modified resources, compare changes when needed, move the files that belong in the next commit to the staged area, and commit only the changes that belong together.</p>
  </conbody>
</concept>
